        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "AFSCME may change the certified dues amount once per calendar year, and all costs associated with accomplishing such changes in the dues amount (machine, programming, etc) shall be paid by AFSCME at the same rates that apply to other employee organizations described in the University Accounting Manual. Any annual changes in the amount to be deducted for AFSCME dues shall be certified to the University, in writing, at least forty-five (45) calendar days prior to the effective date of the dues amount change. The University shall provide AFSCME with estimated costs and an estimated time of completion and AFSCME shall pay the agreed-upon costs before the University makes the change.",
            "block_bbox": [
