            "block_content": "New individual authorizations for an AFSCME payroll dues deduction must be presented to the designated office at the employee's campus/hospital/Laboratory location and the appropriate deduction will commence as soon thereafter as the authorization for such deduction is entered into the locations' payroll system, in no case later than forty-five (45) calendar days.",
