        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Bargaining unit members who are members of AFSCME on or after the effective date of this Agreement who wish to withdraw from Union membership may do so during a period of thirty (30) days after the effective date of this Agreement, and during the annual window period (except there shall be no annual window period in 2002) which shall be thirty (30) days prior to the annual anniversary date of the Agreement (May 1) by filing a written notice with the University. Withdrawal notices received by the University at other times during the effective contract dates shall be returned to the bargaining unit employees by the University.",
